endpoint.response:
Report Excel (default `storage/app/private/realign/registry-referents-{Ymd-His}-{apply|dry}.xlsx`), fogli:
`Referenti collegati` (legacy_id, qnet2_id, registry, slot, referent_id, referent, created: bool, contacts_added: int);
`Principali cambiati` (legacy_id, qnet2_id, registry, old_primary, new_primary, reason: "referente_1"|"commerciale");
`Anagrafiche saltate` (legacy_id, qnet2_id, registry, reason).
Riepilogo a video: anagrafiche lette, referenti creati, referenti abbinati, principali cambiati, principali lasciati perche' cambiati a mano.
